Subject: [PATCH 07/20] feat: add reasoning and template kwargs injection

Add reasoning on/off/auto and chat-template-kwargs
Inject template kwargs into Minja context (extra_context)
Add Minja-compatible Qwen3 template for testing

Task: #599619

From: llama.cpp
From-Url: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp.git #2c1f199

Severity: Important

